(5223166, 759384, 91527, '<td valign="top"><i>I listen to the wind <br/>to the wind of my soul<br/>Where I''ll end up well I think <br/>only God really knows<br/>I''ve sat upon the setting sun<br/>but never, never never never<br/>I never wanted water once<br/>no never, never, never<br/> <br/>I listen to my words but<br/>they fall far below<br/>I let my music take me where <br/>my heart wants to go<br/>I swam upon the devil''s lake <br/>but never, never never never<br/>I''ll never make the same mistake<br/> <br/>No never, never, never<br/> <br/>- by Cat Stevens </i> <br/> <br/>That''s what your photo made me think of :)<br/> <br/>I love the moodiness of this...but it seems more like silence to me than sound.  Great shot though!</td>', 'I listen to the wind to the wind of my soulWhere I''ll end up well I think only God really knowsI''ve sat upon the setting sunbut never, never never neverI never wanted water onceno never, never, never I listen to my words butthey fall far belowI let my music take me where my heart wants to goI swam upon the devil''s lake but never, never never neverI''ll never make the same mistake No never, never, never - by Cat Stevens   That''s what your photo made me think of :) I love the moodiness of this...but it seems more like silence to me than sound.  Great shot though!', '2009-01-28 00:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
