(5223343, 760349, 91527, '<td valign="top">I agree with your assessment...the blurred display definitely detracts from the image, as does the overly bright ring thingy...the player itself is quite well-done though, sharp and clear.<br/> <br/>It''s ridiculously hard to photograph electronics; I photographed my cellphone once, and had to use the GIMP to put the screen in afterwards.<br/> <br/>A couple other detractors are the funky pattern in the upper part of the picture and the constellation of dust/hot pixels in the left.<br/> <br/>Had I been voting, this would probably been a 4 or a 5...</td>', 'I agree with your assessment...the blurred display definitely detracts from the image, as does the overly bright ring thingy...the player itself is quite well-done though, sharp and clear. It''s ridiculously hard to photograph electronics; I photographed my cellphone once, and had to use the GIMP to put the screen in afterwards. A couple other detractors are the funky pattern in the upper part of the picture and the constellation of dust/hot pixels in the left. Had I been voting, this would probably been a 4 or a 5...', '2009-01-28 01:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
