(5226076, 759287, 83313, '<td valign="top">I assume the sound is a hum of electricity through wires? Or bovines grazing? (Chomp, chomp.) I''m afraid this pic is coming off to me a a bit flat. Perhaps some adjustments of levels and curves could give it some more pop. I copied this to see and found the histogram is flat along the rightmost 1/4. Adjusting the levels helped this a lot, bringing out lots of brightness and detail.</td>', 'I assume the sound is a hum of electricity through wires? Or bovines grazing? (Chomp, chomp.) I''m afraid this pic is coming off to me a a bit flat. Perhaps some adjustments of levels and curves could give it some more pop. I copied this to see and found the histogram is flat along the rightmost 1/4. Adjusting the levels helped this a lot, bringing out lots of brightness and detail.', '2009-01-29 13:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226080, 759773, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost exactly what my dad used to say. Funny thing is, I was listening to country music.</td>', 'Almost exactly what my dad used to say. Funny thing is, I was listening to country music.', '2009-01-29 13:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226085, 759090, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, except for what looks like some harsh flash. Could possibly use some color adjustment of levels, curves and saturation. Depends on what look you were going for though.</td>', 'Nice, except for what looks like some harsh flash. Could possibly use some color adjustment of levels, curves and saturation. Depends on what look you were going for though.', '2009-01-29 13:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
