(5226354, 760343, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt.  Might have been better if you actually had some speakers or if the TV was actually on... though I guess that would have screwed up your lighting.</td>', 'I like the attempt.  Might have been better if you actually had some speakers or if the TV was actually on... though I guess that would have screwed up your lighting.', '2009-01-29 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
