(5226356, 760270, 102024, '<td valign="top">Nice backspin!  Good idea, but this image seems a little isolated which, to me, muffles the sound.  Either more intimate with the objects or a broader scope with the alley might be interesting.</td>', 'Nice backspin!  Good idea, but this image seems a little isolated which, to me, muffles the sound.  Either more intimate with the objects or a broader scope with the alley might be interesting.', '2009-01-29 16:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226359, 759341, 102024, '<td valign="top">The composition doesn''t do it for me.  The placement of the subjects in the frame is extremely bold, but it doesn''t do much for the image.  The speed limit sign could be more in focus, and the way it''s framed up it splits the image too much.  The aircraft is sharp but since it appears next to the sign instead of, say, above it, they feel like two separate images.</td>', 'The composition doesn''t do it for me.  The placement of the subjects in the frame is extremely bold, but it doesn''t do much for the image.  The speed limit sign could be more in focus, and the way it''s framed up it splits the image too much.  The aircraft is sharp but since it appears next to the sign instead of, say, above it, they feel like two separate images.', '2009-01-29 17:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226362, 760390, 102024, '<td valign="top">I always like these shots, but I really don''t think the white background does much for this photograph.  Perhaps a darker color could really make those water droplets pop.</td>', 'I always like these shots, but I really don''t think the white background does much for this photograph.  Perhaps a darker color could really make those water droplets pop.', '2009-01-29 17:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
