(5229607, 760408, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly well composed photograph. The 3 sections with different textures and tones along with the little lone bird in the middle is just fantastic. I wonder if this might do better in silence though? over 2/3 of the photograph is very calm. Either way, very nice.</td>', 'This is an incredibly well composed photograph. The 3 sections with different textures and tones along with the little lone bird in the middle is just fantastic. I wonder if this might do better in silence though? over 2/3 of the photograph is very calm. Either way, very nice.', '2009-01-31 19:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229608, 760222, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I love the concept but the lighting need to be more dramatic.  As is, the B&amp;W conversion doesn''t have enough contrast.  You might want to check out the tutorial in the Learn drop down menu. Still worth a 7 for the great use of motion to convey sound.</td>', 'Back to comment: I love the concept but the lighting need to be more dramatic.  As is, the B&W conversion doesn''t have enough contrast.  You might want to check out the tutorial in the Learn drop down menu. Still worth a 7 for the great use of motion to convey sound.', '2009-01-31 19:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229611, 759921, 70000, '<td valign="top">WOW! I almost passed this right up as a typical dramatic sunset at sea, but this is just SO much more than that. Not only is the water composed brilliantly, the colors are subtle and dramatic. The sky has calm blues and purples while the water is clearly being hit by some bright sunlight. The birds are a great touch too. Nicely done.</td>', 'WOW! I almost passed this right up as a typical dramatic sunset at sea, but this is just SO much more than that. Not only is the water composed brilliantly, the colors are subtle and dramatic. The sky has calm blues and purples while the water is clearly being hit by some bright sunlight. The birds are a great touch too. Nicely done.', '2009-01-31 19:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229613, 759793, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Great execution of an everyday object with a well recognized sound.  9</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Great execution of an everyday object with a well recognized sound.  9', '2009-01-31 19:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229615, 759587, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Very well executed. 8</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Very well executed. 8', '2009-01-31 19:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229619, 760195, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: The title is worth a 7 on its own.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: The title is worth a 7 on its own.  Very nicely done.', '2009-01-31 19:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229672, 759281, 103102, '<td valign="top">Like the light painting</td>', 'Like the light painting', '2009-01-31 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229908, 759346, 68947, '<td valign="top">Their sound is thunderous when in groups and yet, ever so peaceful when beside water...especially, the roar of waves, pounding over the beach.  I can almost hear them as they squawk in an attempt to go after the food being thrown out for the masses.  Bring out a lot of memories.  Beautiful capture and fits the challenge well!</td>', 'Their sound is thunderous when in groups and yet, ever so peaceful when beside water...especially, the roar of waves, pounding over the beach.  I can almost hear them as they squawk in an attempt to go after the food being thrown out for the masses.  Bring out a lot of memories.  Beautiful capture and fits the challenge well!', '2009-01-31 22:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229912, 760327, 68947, '<td valign="top">I can hear the movement of his fingers, tapping out a beat, one movement, melding into the next, scarcely having left the movement prior.  The movement shown really conveys the sound.  Nicely cropped.</td>', 'I can hear the movement of his fingers, tapping out a beat, one movement, melding into the next, scarcely having left the movement prior.  The movement shown really conveys the sound.  Nicely cropped.', '2009-01-31 22:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229914, 760232, 68947, '<td valign="top">The roughness of his hands, the curl of the tips of his fingers show hardworking, yet sensitive gentle hands that are capable of working for a living but, playing for enjoyment.  Works well in this tone and contrast to show the effect of sound.</td>', 'The roughness of his hands, the curl of the tips of his fingers show hardworking, yet sensitive gentle hands that are capable of working for a living but, playing for enjoyment.  Works well in this tone and contrast to show the effect of sound.', '2009-01-31 22:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229916, 759064, 68947, '<td valign="top">Anyone got a beer?  You may need it, given the intensity on this man''s face!  Or, perhaps, he''s got a bit of "ham" in him?  I think we can all hear this one!  Love the color and print combo.</td>', 'Anyone got a beer?  You may need it, given the intensity on this man''s face!  Or, perhaps, he''s got a bit of "ham" in him?  I think we can all hear this one!  Love the color and print combo.', '2009-01-31 22:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229918, 759843, 68947, '<td valign="top">Is everyone ready?  Can I start?  It seems as though she''s waiting for her chance to begin with uncertainty....as though, looking for some signal to be given to her.  <br/> <br/>The B&amp;W works well with a rather candid shot that tells us what''s not only on her mind but, what she is about to begin.</td>', 'Is everyone ready?  Can I start?  It seems as though she''s waiting for her chance to begin with uncertainty....as though, looking for some signal to be given to her.   The B&W works well with a rather candid shot that tells us what''s not only on her mind but, what she is about to begin.', '2009-01-31 22:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229922, 759271, 68947, '<td valign="top">TA DA!!!!  I''m done....I finally drove mom crazy!  Where''s the applause?  Boy am I proud of myself!  I can almost hear the clanging in my ears. LOL<br/> <br/>Wonderful set up and nice against the white background.  Hope you''re going to frame this one!</td>', 'TA DA!!!!  I''m done....I finally drove mom crazy!  Where''s the applause?  Boy am I proud of myself!  I can almost hear the clanging in my ears. LOL Wonderful set up and nice against the white background.  Hope you''re going to frame this one!', '2009-01-31 22:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229925, 760270, 68947, '<td valign="top">I can hear the balls rolling down the aisles on either side as this ball clunks the pins, wondering how many others may go down with the first two. Will there be more points scored?  <br/> <br/>Conveys the sound for anyone who has ever been in a bowling alley!</td>', 'I can hear the balls rolling down the aisles on either side as this ball clunks the pins, wondering how many others may go down with the first two. Will there be more points scored?   Conveys the sound for anyone who has ever been in a bowling alley!', '2009-01-31 22:32:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5229926, 759057, 68947, '<td valign="top">EEEEkkkkkkkkkkkk........someone get him out of here!  Darn brothers anyways!  I''m going to get him back.  Just wait and see.  He''s in for it now!  LOL<br/> <br/>We can SEE that sound!  Really made me chuckle!  Very creative!</td>', 'EEEEkkkkkkkkkkkk........someone get him out of here!  Darn brothers anyways!  I''m going to get him back.  Just wait and see.  He''s in for it now!  LOL We can SEE that sound!  Really made me chuckle!  Very creative!', '2009-01-31 22:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229929, 760339, 68947, '<td valign="top">AAAAAAhhhhhhhh.......forgot that I turned it up last night.  Should have remembered that before I stuck these things on!  <br/> <br/>While we can''t hear the sound he hears, we can hear his gasp at it!  LOL<br/> <br/>Really a cute shot that portrays those "ooopsss moments" when we don''t remember to turn the volume down when putting on headphones.</td>', 'AAAAAAhhhhhhhh.......forgot that I turned it up last night.  Should have remembered that before I stuck these things on!   While we can''t hear the sound he hears, we can hear his gasp at it!  LOL Really a cute shot that portrays those "ooopsss moments" when we don''t remember to turn the volume down when putting on headphones.', '2009-01-31 22:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229933, 760206, 68947, '<td valign="top">Don''t you dare tease me...I''ve got TEETH!  Even if I don''t use them, I''m gonna make you think that I will...now, give it back!!! <br/> <br/>Love the captured moment and the look in this little one''s eyes.  Great action capture!</td>', 'Don''t you dare tease me...I''ve got TEETH!  Even if I don''t use them, I''m gonna make you think that I will...now, give it back!!!  Love the captured moment and the look in this little one''s eyes.  Great action capture!', '2009-01-31 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229939, 760091, 68947, '<td valign="top">Am I going to fall?  Nobody move.  Where''s the exit?  Oh please, someone get me to the side!  HELP ME!!!  LOL<br/> <br/>Love the actual expression on the faces and the moment that makes one feel as though they know what''s going through minds.  I can hear the cruches of the skates, biting into the ice and the......QUIET SCREAMS, going on inside that head!</td>', 'Am I going to fall?  Nobody move.  Where''s the exit?  Oh please, someone get me to the side!  HELP ME!!!  LOL Love the actual expression on the faces and the moment that makes one feel as though they know what''s going through minds.  I can hear the cruches of the skates, biting into the ice and the......QUIET SCREAMS, going on inside that head!', '2009-01-31 22:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229940, 760222, 68947, '<td valign="top">NO MORE PHOTOS!!!  I can''t take it anymore!  If I see that camera stuck in my face again, Im going to SCREAM!!!!  Oooopppppsssss...was that ME?</td>', 'NO MORE PHOTOS!!!  I can''t take it anymore!  If I see that camera stuck in my face again, Im going to SCREAM!!!!  Oooopppppsssss...was that ME?', '2009-01-31 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229942, 760434, 68947, '<td valign="top">I can''t use words yet so this is the only way that I can let you know what I want.  When I cry, you listen....I am heard!  <br/> <br/>Beautiful portrayal of a baby''s cry and looks like a tooth about to pop through any day now so, it''s no wonder there''s some tears! *smile*</td>', 'I can''t use words yet so this is the only way that I can let you know what I want.  When I cry, you listen....I am heard!   Beautiful portrayal of a baby''s cry and looks like a tooth about to pop through any day now so, it''s no wonder there''s some tears! *smile*', '2009-01-31 22:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229946, 758981, 68947, '<td valign="top">Who''s there?  I see you!  Just letting you know that I do see you.  Call it your first warning...then, I leap up and run towards you, barking even louder. <br/> <br/>I love that the face is in focus and the rest of the body not because it highlights the intensity of the eyes and knowing that it is an un-urgent bark...at this moment at least!  B&amp;W works very well!</td>', 'Who''s there?  I see you!  Just letting you know that I do see you.  Call it your first warning...then, I leap up and run towards you, barking even louder.  I love that the face is in focus and the rest of the body not because it highlights the intensity of the eyes and knowing that it is an un-urgent bark...at this moment at least!  B&W works very well!', '2009-01-31 22:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
