(5235867, 759090, 103142, '<td valign="top">I only have a very short time to score this category. I just wanted you to know that I scored this a 7, but as soon as I clicked the button to go to the next screen, this picture called me back. I''m moving it to a 9 just because it made me come back for a second look. Not many picture make you rethink yourself.</td>', 'I only have a very short time to score this category. I just wanted you to know that I scored this a 7, but as soon as I clicked the button to go to the next screen, this picture called me back. I''m moving it to a 9 just because it made me come back for a second look. Not many picture make you rethink yourself.', '2009-02-02 18:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235873, 760380, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea--but I think it needed to be processed more. Overall, it seems very dark. I think there could be much more in the highlights and contrast. Also, the depth of field seems very short. I don''t mind the lower left out of focus, but since the category is sound, having the right bell so fuzzy seems distracting</td>', 'I really like the idea--but I think it needed to be processed more. Overall, it seems very dark. I think there could be much more in the highlights and contrast. Also, the depth of field seems very short. I don''t mind the lower left out of focus, but since the category is sound, having the right bell so fuzzy seems distracting', '2009-02-02 18:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235877, 760343, 103142, '<td valign="top">There''s movement in the lamp and the thing by the chair, but no movement in him. I would have liked to see him look like his head is being pushed back, or something. he''s too static.<br/> <br/>Also, it seems very dark. I think it could use a little lightening.</td>', 'There''s movement in the lamp and the thing by the chair, but no movement in him. I would have liked to see him look like his head is being pushed back, or something. he''s too static. Also, it seems very dark. I think it could use a little lightening.', '2009-02-02 18:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
