(5238145, 760343, 40718, '<td valign="top">I give you full props for having the guts to add the noise to duplicate the softness of the original.  I thought about it and even tried, but I knew it wouldn''t fly here on DPC.  My only suggestion on this update would be for you to have had the TV on. :)</td>', 'I give you full props for having the guts to add the noise to duplicate the softness of the original.  I thought about it and even tried, but I knew it wouldn''t fly here on DPC.  My only suggestion on this update would be for you to have had the TV on. :)', '2009-02-04 00:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
