(5238299, 759788, 100064, '<td valign="top">I like this one! I would have given it a 7. <br/> <br/>I dont like the price of the lensbabys tho. I think they are outrageous for what they do. Whats the difference in just buying a filter that has a center focus on it and pointing it somewhere else? I dont get the whole lensbaby thing but for a couple of hundred bucks? I would rather buy a studio lighting kit. hahah.</td>', 'I like this one! I would have given it a 7.  I dont like the price of the lensbabys tho. I think they are outrageous for what they do. Whats the difference in just buying a filter that has a center focus on it and pointing it somewhere else? I dont get the whole lensbaby thing but for a couple of hundred bucks? I would rather buy a studio lighting kit. hahah.', '2009-02-04 00:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
