(5238600, 760343, 87808, '<td valign="top">I was thinking about your shot adn obviously the TV issue.  Maybe cutting out a piece of white paper adn sticking on the TV would give the impression of it being on, this would also not give you any of the light from the TV which take away from the shot.  Full kudos for trying this shot, well done</td>', 'I was thinking about your shot adn obviously the TV issue.  Maybe cutting out a piece of white paper adn sticking on the TV would give the impression of it being on, this would also not give you any of the light from the TV which take away from the shot.  Full kudos for trying this shot, well done', '2009-02-04 06:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
