(5238699, 759165, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Doc.  Funny thing is that old poster (and tv commercial) were the first things that came to mind when the challenge was announced, but it never occurred to me to try and recreate it.  Well done!<br/> <br/>PS: Just do a Google Image search on "Maxell" and you''ll see the original poster.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-04 07:51:19.</i></td>', 'Congrats, Doc.  Funny thing is that old poster (and tv commercial) were the first things that came to mind when the challenge was announced, but it never occurred to me to try and recreate it.  Well done! PS: Just do a Google Image search on "Maxell" and you''ll see the original poster.', '2009-02-04 07:50:07.000000', '2009-02-04 07:51:19.000000', 0),
