(5245317, 759165, 24212, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by brumer0:</b></div><hr/><i> you got five freakin'' 1s!? i mean, honestly folks. wtf? honestly, this wasnt my favorite photo, but it is a dang good one!!!!! Those who voted 1s and 2s, ok, all below a 6 at LEAST, go and jump off a cliff and make this site better!<br/> <br/>Nice photo dude, nice. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I love this photo and would have given it a 10 if I had been voting (great tones and outstanding attention to detail make this stand out for me), although I accept (unlike some others, apparently) that other people may hold a different view from the one that I hold. Maybe I should jump off a cliff for having an opinion.</td>', 'Originally posted by brumer0: you got five freakin'' 1s!? i mean, honestly folks. wtf? honestly, this wasnt my favorite photo, but it is a dang good one!!!!! Those who voted 1s and 2s, ok, all below a 6 at LEAST, go and jump off a cliff and make this site better! Nice photo dude, nice.   I love this photo and would have given it a 10 if I had been voting (great tones and outstanding attention to detail make this stand out for me), although I accept (unlike some others, apparently) that other people may hold a different view from the one that I hold. Maybe I should jump off a cliff for having an opinion.', '2009-02-08 13:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
