(5259203, 760140, 76430, '<td valign="top">Yosef, since I got your only comment the least I could do is comment on your entry that got no comments.  I think you had a very creative view on this challenge.  This is pretty easily recognizable, but just abstract enough to look like a close-up of an eye.  The grill appears to be a little bit crooked, along with the writing on the bottom, but just a bit.  It may have been better either not clipped at all or clipped more drastically on all four sides.  It looks like noise on the rim, but I think it''s just the texture of the rim.  I like your lighting and keeping the background black. You''ve only been in two challenges so far, but based on your photographer''s comments it looks like you have a good grasp on editing skills.  Don''t let the two poor scores get to you.  Keep entering.</td>', 'Yosef, since I got your only comment the least I could do is comment on your entry that got no comments.  I think you had a very creative view on this challenge.  This is pretty easily recognizable, but just abstract enough to look like a close-up of an eye.  The grill appears to be a little bit crooked, along with the writing on the bottom, but just a bit.  It may have been better either not clipped at all or clipped more drastically on all four sides.  It looks like noise on the rim, but I think it''s just the texture of the rim.  I like your lighting and keeping the background black. You''ve only been in two challenges so far, but based on your photographer''s comments it looks like you have a good grasp on editing skills.  Don''t let the two poor scores get to you.  Keep entering.', '2009-02-16 16:01:54.000000', NULL, 0),
