(5615436, 759647, 99981, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you had a bad idea, at least i admire a close-up like this, i think it''s a nice abstract. <br/>I just think that the white levels are too harsh, what even makes the object almost unidentified. Again, i think you had a nice idea with the abstract but you crop doesn''t justify for me too, i don''t think the white spaces are well organized, too much at the left and a little one at the top right. I think some nice and bright colors at the silver part would be nice.<br/>Just trying to help, because you asked on a thread. I hope i wasn''t rude, i''m not experient but i try to help!<br/> <br/>PS: I saw the pp you did on a portrait at your portfolio (making the lady look younger). Woa! It''s really great!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-18 12:07:59.</i></td>', 'I don''t think you had a bad idea, at least i admire a close-up like this, i think it''s a nice abstract. I just think that the white levels are too harsh, what even makes the object almost unidentified. Again, i think you had a nice idea with the abstract but you crop doesn''t justify for me too, i don''t think the white spaces are well organized, too much at the left and a little one at the top right. I think some nice and bright colors at the silver part would be nice.Just trying to help, because you asked on a thread. I hope i wasn''t rude, i''m not experient but i try to help! PS: I saw the pp you did on a portrait at your portfolio (making the lady look younger). Woa! It''s really great!', '2009-08-18 13:06:08.000000', '2009-08-18 13:07:59.000000', 0),
